Devices:
The Get {Phone Image ids} by {Custom id} API of the Mobile Phone Specs Database tool (Devices): Get up to 10 phone images (IDs). 
Use these IDs in the Endpoint:  Get {Image} by {Phone Image id}
The image IDs expire after 30 minutes.

Weather:
The Ocean Conditions Closest to Latitude / Longitude API of the Wavebase tool (Weather): ​https://api.wavebase.app/v4/conditions/search/{latitude}/{longitude}

Search for current and predicted ocean conditions closest to a given latitude/longitude.

Returned conditions include the closest point found, along with Waves, Tides and Weather conditions are the location.
